    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d340">

                <pb facs="0990" n="974" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg974"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    S/S–NSC Files,
                    Lot 63 D 351, NSC 97 Series</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Executive Secretary of the National
                        Security Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-11">December 11,
                        1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the National Security Council</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Security of Certain Middle East Areas</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">References: A. NSC 97 Series
                    on “A National Petroleum Program.”<lb/>B. Senior NSC Staff Project on “The Eastern Mediterranean and Middle
                        East.”<anchor n="1" xml:id="d340-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>The attached memorandum from the Secretary of Defense,<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d340-f2"/> containing excerpts from a Joint Chiefs of Staff paper on
                    the subject, is transmitted for the information of the National Security Council
                    in connection with the reference projects.</p>


                <xi:include href="d340-a1.xml" xpointer="d340-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d340-f1" n="1" xml:id="d340-f1-content">
                <p>In 1952, the project under reference produced reports in the NSC 129 series, “U.S. Objectives and Policies With
                    Respect to the Arab States and Israel.” Documentation regarding that series will
                    he treated in a subsequent volume in the <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi> series.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d340-f2" n="2" xml:id="d340-f2-content">
                <p>Robert A. Lovett.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
